bb: byte progress ('Progress-bytes: <done> <total>') for ps4-pkg-tool, 64-bit sizes/offsets
(the original keeps int offsets/sizes: wrong for PFS data beyond 2 GiB, i.e. multi-GB game PKGs),
and refusal of file names that could leave the output folder.

